From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: s800x-6s: Add the CS42L71 headset codec

The IPSW device trees of the iPhone 6s and 6s Plus (N66, N66m, N71,
N71m, iOS 15.8.8) put the CS42L71 on SPI1, chip select AP GPIO 16.
This node is for a probe-only driver: SPIv2 port bring-up and an ID
read. There is no sound card and MCA0 is left disabled, so the
working CS35L21 loudspeaker on pad 2 / MCA2 is not disturbed.

Do not put clocks or a DAI on this node until the control port is
proven. IRQ 139 (jack detect) and the D2255 LDO pulldown are not
described yet. SPI is 1 MHz, mode 0.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800x-6s.dtsi | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800x-6s.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800x-6s.dtsi
index 7dba5a1e2..6s-cs42l71 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800x-6s.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800x-6s.dtsi
@@ -224,6 +224,24 @@
 		#sound-dai-cells = <0>;
 	};
 };
+
+/*
+ * Headset codec of the iPhone 6s and 6s Plus: CS42L71 on SPI1 (ADT
+ * spi1/audio-codec, CS GPIO 16). Probe-only: no sound card, no MCA0,
+ * no MCLK. Pad 2 / ASP stays with the CS35L21 on MCA2.
+ */
+&spi1 {
+	/* ADT function-spi_cs0: AP GPIO 16, active low */
+	cs-gpios = <&pinctrl_ap 16 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+	status = "okay";
+
+	cs42l71: audio-codec@0 {
+		compatible = "cirrus,cs42l71";
+		reg = <0>;
+		/* ADT bit period 83 ns (~12 MHz); 1 MHz until the port is proven */
+		spi-max-frequency = <1000000>;
+	};
+};
 
 &framebuffer0 {
 	power-domains = <&ps_disp0 &ps_mipi_dsi>;
-- 
